    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n**DNG 3D VIRTUAL TOUR OF THIS PROPERTY AVAILABLE**\n\nExcellent well maintained extended two-bedroom end of terrace residence in mature residential setting, comprising entrance hallway, living room leading to kitchen/dining area, and utility /store Circa 92.3 sq.m. 993 sq. ft.\n\nLocated just off Nutgrove Avenue within walking distance of Rathfarnham Village & Nutgrove Shopping Centre and close to all recreational facilities, Dundrum Town Centre, local primary and secondary schools, and public transport (Routes 16 & S6). \n\nThere is gas fired central heating, double glazed windows, private patio & gardens to rear, circa 54 ft. carpets and drapes are included in the sale."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nLiving Room - 4.2m x 7.0m\nWith cast iron fireplace with solid fuel stove, built in bookcases & hardwood floor, understairs storage, glass panel door leading to....\n\nKitchen/Dining - 4.0m x 3.7m\nWith a large selection of fitted presses, gas cooker & dishwasher with tiled floor, patio doors to private garden circa 54ft. Covered Side Passage/Utility area\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nLanding - 1.7m x 2.1m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.3m x 3.0m\nWith built in sliderobes, t&g floors\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.4m x 3.1m\nWith built in sliderobes\n\nBathroom - 1.7m x 1.6m\nWith tiled floor & walls with walk in shower, heated towel rail\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Gas Fired Central Heating</li><li> Double Glazed Windows</li><li> Mature Rear Garden Circa 54ft with Patio</li><li> Telephone and Cable T.V. available.</li><li> Carpets & Drapes</li><li> Floor Area c. 92.3sq.m. 993 sq. ft.</ul>"
      },
